# Ghost HMS 🏥

An offline-first Hospital Management System built specifically for Nigerian hospitals and clinics.

## Vision

To simplify hospital operations with fast, reliable, and accessible healthcare software.

## Features

- Patient Registration
- Appointment Scheduling
- Medical Records
- Pharmacy Management
- Billing
- Offline-First Architecture

## Tech Stack

- React
- Node.js
- Express
- PostgreSQL
- Prisma
- Tailwind CSS

## Status

🚧 Under Active Development
